# Through the Quicksand Caves: another fight's win. The Clotho Orb traded to SC_Entrance opens Cactuar
# Suave's menu (32000, bit 32); option 81 (index 5, area 1) enters it (A_CRACK_HAS_FORMED 7548, entering
# 7609). A GM's win plays 32001 (index 5); its finish leaves the mission current: the win is Cactuar
# Suave's, not this fight's.
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrade ChamberOfOracles/onEventUpdate/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=-218.6,-1.9,23.0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ThroughTheQuicksandCaves current
item ClothoOrb
login
trade SC_Entrance ClothoOrb x1          # Cactuar Suave's menu (bit 32)
update 32000 option=81                  # index 5, area 1: entered
finish
tick 2000
bfwin                                   # a GM's win: 32001
finish                                  # Cactuar Suave's win: still current
